---
const sections = [
  {
    number: "01",
    label: "IDENTITY",
    title: "A LAB FOR<br /><span>PEOPLE.</span>",
    copy:
      "Barkly Labs is an independent technology laboratory building human-centered systems, experimental tools, research infrastructure, and open technology.",
  },
  {
    number: "02",
    label: "WHY WE EXIST",
    title: "TECHNOLOGY<br /><span>SHOULD HELP.</span>",
    copy:
      "Technology is powerful. But power alone is not the goal. Barkly exists to make complex technology more useful, understandable, accessible, creative, and human.",
  },
  {
    number: "03",
    label: "THE LAB",
    title: "BUILD.<br /><span>LEARN.</span><br />REPEAT.",
    copy:
      "Barkly is a place for experimentation. Systems are built, tested, documented, questioned, improved, and released so that knowledge can become infrastructure.",
  },
];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta
      name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"
    />
    <title>About — Barkly Labs</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Barkly Labs is an independent technology laboratory building human-centered systems, research infrastructure, and open technology."
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="page">

      <!-- HEADER -->
      <header class="site-header">
        <div class="header-logo">
          <a href="/">
            <span>BARKLY</span> <strong>LABS</strong>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="header-document">
          <span>ABOUT</span>
          <span>/</span>
          <span>DOCUMENT 000</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- SIDE NAV -->
      <aside class="side-nav">
        <a href="#identity">
          <span>01</span>
          IDENTITY
        </a>

        <a href="#purpose">
          <span>02</span>
          PURPOSE
        </a>

        <a href="#lab">
          <span>03</span>
          THE LAB
        </a>

        <a href="#systems">
          <span>04</span>
          SYSTEMS
        </a>

        <a href="#people">
          <span>05</span>
          PEOPLE
        </a>

        <a href="#future">
          <span>06</span>
          FUTURE
        </a>
      </aside>

      <!-- HERO -->
      <main>

        <section class="hero" id="identity">
          <div class="section-meta">
            <span>BARKLY LABS</span>
            <span>ABOUT / DOCUMENT 000</span>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-title">
            <h1>
              WE BUILD<br />
              <span>THE LAB.</span>
            </h1>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-bottom">
            <p class="hero-copy">
              Barkly Labs is an independent technology laboratory
              building systems for people — and building the
              infrastructure that makes experimentation possible.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-mark">
              HUMAN<br />
              FIRST
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>


        <!-- PURPOSE -->
        <section class="content-section" id="purpose">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="section-number">02</span>

            <div>
              <span class="eyebrow">WHY BARKLY EXISTS</span>

              <h2>
                TECHNOLOGY<br />
                SHOULD <span>HELP.</span>
              </h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="section-body">
            <p class="large-copy">
              Technology should make human life more possible,
              not more difficult.
            </p>

            <p>
              Barkly Labs exists because powerful technology is
              often designed around systems, markets, or technical
              capabilities before the people who have to live with it.
            </p>

            <p>
              We build differently.
            </p>

            <p>
              People are treated as part of the system from the
              beginning — their needs, limitations, creativity,
              accessibility, understanding, and agency all matter.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>


        <!-- THE LAB -->
        <section class="content-section lab-section" id="lab">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="section-number">03</span>

            <div>
              <span class="eyebrow">THE LABORATORY</span>

              <h2>
                BUILD.<br />
                <span>LEARN.</span><br />
                REPEAT.
              </h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="lab-content">
            <div class="lab-intro">
              <p class="large-copy">
                Barkly is not only a company or a collection of
                software projects.
              </p>

              <p>
                It is an environment for turning ideas into systems.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="lab-process">
              <div>
                <span>01</span>
                <strong>BUILD</strong>
                <p>
                  Turn ideas, problems, and experiments into
                  working systems.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <span>02</span>
                <strong>TEST</strong>
                <p>
                  Put those systems in front of real humans and
                  discover what actually works.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <span>03</span>
                <strong>DOCUMENT</strong>
                <p>
                  Preserve what was learned so knowledge does not
                  disappear with the experiment.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <span>04</span>
                <strong>SHARE</strong>
                <p>
                  Release useful work so other people can inspect,
                  improve, adapt, and build upon it.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>


        <!-- SYSTEMS -->
        <section class="content-section" id="systems">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="section-number">04</span>

            <div>
              <span class="eyebrow">THE ECOSYSTEM</span>

              <h2>
                ONE LAB.<br />
                <span>MANY SYSTEMS.</span>
              </h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ecosystem-content">

            <p class="large-copy">
              Barkly Labs is built as an ecosystem rather than
              a single product.
            </p>

            <div class="system-list">

              <a href="/cyn-x" class="system-card">
                <div>
                  <span class="system-number">01</span>
                  <strong>CYN-X</strong>
                </div>

                <p>
                  AI systems and experimentation built around
                  human-centered interaction.
                </p>

                <small>AI / RESEARCH / EXPERIMENTATION</small>
              </a>

              <a href="/docs" class="system-card">
                <div>
                  <span class="system-number">02</span>
                  <strong>BARKLY DOCS</strong>
                </div>

                <p>
                  Documentation infrastructure for understanding
                  how systems are built and how they work.
                </p>

                <small>DOCUMENTATION / KNOWLEDGE / INFRASTRUCTURE</small>
              </a>

              <a href="/laas" class="system-card">
                <div>
                  <span class="system-number">03</span>
                  <strong>LAAS</strong>
                </div>

                <p>
                  Laboratory as a Service — infrastructure,
                  environments, tools, and technical capability
                  for experimentation.
                </p>

                <small>LABORATORY / SERVICES / EXPERIMENTATION</small>
              </a>

              <a href="/standard" class="system-card">
                <div>
                  <span class="system-number">04</span>
                  <strong>PAW-HC</strong>
                </div>

                <p>
                  People Are Worth Designing For — Barkly's
                  human-centered AI engineering standard.
                </p>

                <small>STANDARD / HUMAN-CENTERED / ENGINEERING</small>
              </a>

            </div>
          </div>
        </section>


        <!-- PEOPLE -->
        <section class="content-section people-section" id="people">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="section-number">05</span>

            <div>
              <span class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE</span>

              <h2>
                BUILT FOR<br />
                <span>HUMANS.</span>
              </h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="people-content">

            <p class="large-copy">
              Barkly is being built before the community arrives.
            </p>

            <p>
              The goal is not to manufacture a community around
              an empty brand. The goal is to build a real laboratory
              that gives people something worth contributing to.
            </p>

            <p>
              Builders, artists, researchers, engineers, designers,
              experimenters, and curious humans should be able to
              encounter the lab, understand how it works, and find
              a place where their own ideas can become real.
            </p>

            <div class="people-callout">
              <span>THE DOOR IS OPEN</span>

              <p>
                You do not have to already belong here to build
                something here.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </section>


        <!-- FUTURE -->
        <section class="content-section future-section" id="future">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="section-number">06</span>

            <div>
              <span class="eyebrow">WHAT COMES NEXT</span>

              <h2>
                THE LAB<br />
                <span>KEEPS BUILDING.</span>
              </h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="future-content">

            <p class="large-copy">
              Barkly is not finished.
            </p>

            <p>
              New systems will emerge. Existing systems will change.
              Experiments will fail. Ideas will evolve. Documentation
              will grow. The standard will be tested against reality
              and improved through what we learn.
            </p>

            <p>
              That is intentional.
            </p>

            <p>
              A laboratory should not be frozen.
              It should remain capable of discovery.
            </p>

            <div class="future-mark">
              <span>BUILD THE FUTURE.</span>
            </div>

          </div>
        </section>


        <!-- FINAL -->
        <section class="final-section">
          <div class="final-label">
            BARKLY LABS / ABOUT
          </div>

          <h2>
            PEOPLE ARE<br />
            <span>WORTH DESIGNING FOR.</span>
          </h2>

          <p>
            THE LAB IS OPEN.
          </p>
        </section>

      </main>


      <!-- FOOTER -->
      <footer class="site-footer">
        <span>BARKLY LABS</span>
        <span>HUMAN FIRST</span>
        <span>DOCUMENT 000</span>
      </footer>

    </div>
  </body>
</html>


<style>

:global(*) {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

:global(html) {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

:global(body) {
  margin: 0;
  background: #050505;
  color: #f1f1f1;
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}

:root {
  --bg: #050505;
  --panel: #0a0a0a;
  --panel-raised: #0f0f0f;
  --panel-hover: #131313;

  --text: #f1f1f1;
  --white: #f1f1f1;

  --muted: #a1a1a1;
  --dim: #686868;
  --faint: #444;

  --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  --line-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);

  --pink: #ff2f92;
  --pink-soft: rgba(255, 47, 146, 0.10);
  --pink-line: rgba(255, 47, 146, 0.42);

  --max: 1500px;
}


/* HEADER */

.site-header {
  height: 72px;
  padding: 0 4vw;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);

  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
}

.header-logo a {
  color: var(--white);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
}

.header-logo a span {
  color: var(--pink);
}

.header-logo a strong {
  color: var(--white);
}

.header-document {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  color: var(--dim);
}

.header-document span:first-child {
  color: var(--white);
}

.header-document span:last-child {
  color: var(--pink);
}


/* SIDE NAV */

.side-nav {
  position: fixed;
  left: 24px;
  top: 50%;
  z-index: 10;

  transform: translateY(-50%);

  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 14px;

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.side-nav a {
  display: flex;
  gap: 9px;

  color: var(--dim);
  text-decoration: none;

  transition:
    color 0.2s ease,
    transform 0.2s ease;
}

.side-nav a span {
  color: var(--pink);
}

.side-nav a:hover {
  color: var(--white);
  transform: translateX(3px);
}


/* HERO */

.hero {
  max-width: var(--max);
  min-height: 720px;

  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 55px 10vw 100px;

  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.section-meta {
  display: flex;
  gap: 110px;

  color: var(--dim);

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
}

.section-meta span:first-child {
  color: var(--pink);
}

.hero-title {
  margin-top: 35px;
}

.hero-title h1 {
  margin: 0;

  font-size: clamp(76px, 10vw, 150px);
  line-height: 0.88;
  letter-spacing: -0.075em;
  font-weight: 800;
}

.hero-title h1 span {
  color: var(--pink);
}

.hero-bottom {
  margin-top: 90px;

  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns:
    minmax(0, 760px)
    minmax(0, 1fr);

  gap: 80px;
  align-items: end;
}

.hero-copy {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0;

  color: var(--muted);

  font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 29px);
  line-height: 1.55;
}

.hero-mark {
  justify-self: end;

  color: var(--pink);

  font-size: 32px;
  line-height: 0.9;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.05em;
}


/* GENERAL SECTIONS */

.content-section {
  max-width: var(--max);

  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 130px 10vw;

  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);

  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns:
    minmax(280px, 0.8fr)
    minmax(0, 1.2fr);

  gap: 80px;
}


/* HEADINGS */

.section-heading {
  min-width: 0;

  display: flex;
  gap: 25px;
}

.section-heading > div:last-child {
  min-width: 0;
}

.section-number {
  flex-shrink: 0;

  color: var(--pink);

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.eyebrow {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 20px;

  color: var(--dim);

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
}

.section-heading h2 {
  max-width: 100%;
  margin: 0;

  font-size: clamp(45px, 5vw, 78px);
  line-height: 0.92;
  letter-spacing: -0.06em;
}

.section-heading h2 span {
  color: var(--pink);
}


/* BODY */

.section-body,
.lab-content,
.ecosystem-content,
.people-content,
.future-content {
  min-width: 0;
  max-width: 800px;
}

.section-body p,
.people-content p,
.future-content p,
.lab-intro p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.large-copy {
  color: var(--white) !important;

  font-size: 30px !important;
  line-height: 1.35 !important;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}


/* LAB */

.lab-intro {
  margin-bottom: 75px;
}

.lab-process {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.lab-process > div {
  padding: 28px 0;

  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);

  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 50px 180px minmax(0, 1fr);

  gap: 25px;
  align-items: start;
}

.lab-process span,
.system-number {
  color: var(--pink);

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
}

.lab-process strong {
  color: var(--white);

  font-size: 16px;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.lab-process p {
  margin: 0;

  color: var(--muted);

  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}


/* SYSTEMS */

.ecosystem-content > .large-copy {
  margin-top: 0;
  margin-bottom: 55px;
}

.system-list {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.system-card {
  display: block;

  padding: 30px 0;

  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);

  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;

  transition:
    background 0.2s ease,
    padding-left 0.2s ease;
}

.system-card:hover {
  padding-left: 15px;
  background: var(--pink-soft);
}

.system-card > div {
  display: flex;
  gap: 25px;
  align-items: center;
}

.system-card strong {
  color: var(--white);

  font-size: 18px;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}

.system-card p {
  max-width: 650px;
  margin: 18px 0;

  color: var(--muted);

  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.system-card small {
  color: var(--pink);

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}


/* PEOPLE */

.people-content > p {
  margin-top: 0;
}

.people-callout {
  margin-top: 70px;
  padding: 35px;

  border: 1px solid var(--pink-line);
  background: var(--pink-soft);
}

.people-callout span {
  color: var(--pink);

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
}

.people-callout p {
  margin: 25px 0 0;

  color: var(--white) !important;

  font-size: 24px !important;
  line-height: 1.35 !important;
}


/* FUTURE */

.future-content > p:first-child {
  margin-top: 0;
}

.future-mark {
  margin-top: 75px;
  padding-top: 25px;

  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.future-mark span {
  color: var(--pink);

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
}


/* FINAL */

.final-section {
  max-width: var(--max);

  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 170px 10vw 190px;

  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.final-label {
  margin-bottom: 35px;

  color: var(--pink);

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
}

.final-section h2 {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0;

  font-size: clamp(65px, 9vw, 145px);
  line-height: 0.87;
  letter-spacing: -0.075em;
}

.final-section h2 span {
  color: var(--pink);
}

.final-section p {
  margin-top: 55px;

  color: var(--dim);

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}


/* FOOTER */

.site-footer {
  max-width: var(--max);

  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 30px 10vw;

  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);

  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;

  color: var(--dim);

  font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}


/* RESPONSIVE */

@media (max-width: 1100px) {

  .content-section {
    gap: 55px;
  }

  .lab-process > div {
    grid-template-columns:
      45px
      150px
      minmax(0, 1fr);
  }

}


@media (max-width: 900px) {

  .side-nav {
    display: none;
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: auto;
    padding: 50px 7vw 90px;
  }

  .hero-bottom {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 45px;
  }

  .hero-mark {
    justify-self: start;
  }

  .content-section {
    padding: 90px 7vw;

    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
  }

  .lab-process > div {
    grid-template-columns:
      45px
      minmax(0, 1fr);
  }

  .lab-process strong,
  .lab-process p {
    grid-column: 2;
  }

  .final-section {
    padding: 120px 7vw;
  }

  .site-footer {
    padding: 25px 7vw;

    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

}


@media (max-width: 600px) {

  .site-header {
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .header-document {
    display: none;
  }

  .hero-title h1 {
    font-size: 20vw;
  }

  .hero-bottom {
    margin-top: 60px;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    font-size: 19px;
  }

  .section-heading {
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .section-heading h2 {
    font-size: 48px;
  }

  .section-number {
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .lab-process > div {
    padding: 25px 0;
  }

  .system-card {
    padding: 25px 0;
  }

  .people-callout {
    padding: 25px;
  }

  .people-callout p {
    font-size: 21px !important;
  }

  .final-section h2 {
    font-size: 19vw;
  }

}

</style>